    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "\"an exit\"... that sounds almost peaceful, in a dark way. like if i just stopped fighting the cycle completely. but everything tells me that's not an option, that i have to keep trying even when it's killing me. what kind of exit are you even talking about?",
